1
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:49,503
=No.9 Hunter=

2
00:00:49,530 --> 00:00:51,296
=Episode 20=

3
00:00:51,710 --> 00:00:54,357
(Lanruo Hall)

4
00:00:54,799 --> 00:00:58,240
This human girl is quite pretty.

5
00:00:58,240 --> 00:00:59,320
Hahaha.

6
00:00:59,320 --> 00:01:00,119
Where are you going?

7
00:01:00,200 --> 00:01:01,719
Let me go! Let me go!

8
00:01:03,240 --> 00:01:04,519
Let's have some more fun.

9
00:01:06,640 --> 00:01:08,120
Demon! Leave her alone!

10
00:01:08,120 --> 00:01:08,560
Who are you?

11
00:01:08,560 --> 00:01:09,319
You are asking for death.

12
00:01:09,319 --> 00:01:10,719
This is Yu Linjun's domain now.

13
00:01:10,840 --> 00:01:12,719
How dare a mere human act so arrogantly.

14
00:01:13,599 --> 00:01:14,599
I will skin you alive

15
00:01:14,599 --> 00:01:15,959
and hang you on the city gate.

16
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:18,079
Let all humans know
what happens when you cross us.

17
00:01:20,120 --> 00:01:21,359
Heaven's Return Art.

18
00:01:28,760 --> 00:01:32,120
(I've seen this technique before...)

19
00:01:34,519 --> 00:01:35,439
Heaven and earth, lend me power.

20
00:01:35,719 --> 00:01:36,560
All spirits, heed my call.

21
00:01:44,840 --> 00:01:46,200
Lanxi, I'll go take a look.

22
00:01:46,799 --> 00:01:47,599
Hey.

23
00:01:48,799 --> 00:01:50,000
Are you messing with us?

24
00:01:50,640 --> 00:01:51,680
Heaven and earth, lend me power.

25
00:01:51,840 --> 00:01:52,719
All spirits, heed my call.

26
00:01:54,719 --> 00:01:56,040
Heaven and earth, lend me power.

27
00:01:56,400 --> 00:01:57,280
All spirits, heed my call.

28
00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:05,159
(The Wind God Chronicle
is coming from Ziyan...)

29
00:02:07,640 --> 00:02:08,520
(But Ziyan...)

30
00:02:09,479 --> 00:02:12,800
(why do you look at me like
I'm a stranger?)

31
00:02:17,680 --> 00:02:19,039
(This technique is impressive.)

32
00:02:19,759 --> 00:02:20,800
(This person)

33
00:02:21,199 --> 00:02:22,360
(could be useful.)

34
00:02:23,080 --> 00:02:25,000
Who dares ruin my fun?

35
00:02:25,039 --> 00:02:26,080
I will kill you.

36
00:02:26,560 --> 00:02:27,680
Inside Lanruo Hall,

37
00:02:27,800 --> 00:02:29,000
humans and demons are equal.

38
00:02:29,479 --> 00:02:31,319
Those who break the rules shall die.

39
00:02:36,439 --> 00:02:37,719
Run! Run! Run!

40
00:02:40,639 --> 00:02:41,840
Who are you?

41
00:02:43,280 --> 00:02:45,000
(Could Yu Linjun be behind this?)

42
00:02:46,319 --> 00:02:48,400
Do you truly not remember me?

43
00:02:56,840 --> 00:02:58,560
(There is one way)

44
00:02:58,800 --> 00:03:00,319
(to use the Divine Stone
to mend the sky)

45
00:03:01,120 --> 00:03:02,599
(and still keep you alive.)

46
00:03:04,120 --> 00:03:08,120
(My Demon Core
can serve as a vessel for the Stone.)

47
00:03:09,680 --> 00:03:11,919
(This path is fraught with danger.)

48
00:03:11,919 --> 00:03:14,439
(And once the Stone is removed
from her body,)

49
00:03:14,800 --> 00:03:18,719
(she will lose everything about you.)

50
00:03:27,159 --> 00:03:29,280
Staring at me with such longing,

51
00:03:30,319 --> 00:03:32,960
are you trying to get my attention

52
00:03:33,479 --> 00:03:34,840
and win my favor?

53
00:03:38,879 --> 00:03:39,680
Ziyan,

54
00:03:40,400 --> 00:03:44,080
don't tell me
you actually like this human.

55
00:03:44,960 --> 00:03:47,800
What are you saying? I am a demon.

56
00:03:48,560 --> 00:03:51,520
Why would I waste my thoughts on him?

57
00:03:52,159 --> 00:03:53,919
He is nothing but a servant.

58
00:03:54,120 --> 00:03:55,479
If you like him,

59
00:03:55,919 --> 00:03:57,439
we can share him together.

60
00:03:58,400 --> 00:04:01,080
Then I won't hold back.

61
00:04:03,599 --> 00:04:04,840
A young Taoist,

62
00:04:06,280 --> 00:04:07,560
I've never tasted one before.

63
00:04:08,319 --> 00:04:10,639
I bet he's delicious.

64
00:04:11,280 --> 00:04:13,520
Lanxi, didn't you use to hate

65
00:04:13,520 --> 00:04:15,199
men coming near us?

66
00:04:15,840 --> 00:04:17,279
What changed

67
00:04:17,639 --> 00:04:18,759
after you came back?

68
00:04:19,560 --> 00:04:20,879
Life is short.

69
00:04:21,199 --> 00:04:22,399
Enjoy it while you can.

70
00:04:22,839 --> 00:04:24,480
Once you find the cure and eat him,

71
00:04:24,839 --> 00:04:27,480
we can live out our days together.

72
00:04:42,090 --> 00:04:43,210
(Lanruo Hall)

73
00:04:43,240 --> 00:04:44,040
Young Taoist,

74
00:04:45,360 --> 00:04:47,639
that technique you used was interesting.

75
00:04:49,199 --> 00:04:50,120
Teach me.

76
00:04:54,680 --> 00:04:55,600
I will teach you.

77
00:04:59,720 --> 00:05:00,879
Mind anchored in virtue.

78
00:05:01,240 --> 00:05:02,319
Mind anchored in virtue.

79
00:05:04,120 --> 00:05:05,120
Focus your spirit.

80
00:05:05,720 --> 00:05:06,639
Focus your spirit.

81
00:05:08,639 --> 00:05:09,800
Banish demonic influence.

82
00:05:10,199 --> 00:05:11,199
Banish demonic influence.

83
00:05:12,600 --> 00:05:13,759
Let righteousness shine.

84
00:05:16,560 --> 00:05:17,759
Let righteousness shine.

85
00:05:18,279 --> 00:05:19,079
Hmm.

86
00:05:19,519 --> 00:05:20,639
(Mind anchored in virtue.)

87
00:05:20,959 --> 00:05:22,000
(Mind anchored in virtue.)

88
00:05:22,319 --> 00:05:23,319
(Focus your spirit.)

89
00:05:23,519 --> 00:05:24,480
(Focus your spirit.)

90
00:05:25,399 --> 00:05:26,480
(Banish demonic influence.)

91
00:05:26,519 --> 00:05:27,519
(Banish demonic influence.)

92
00:05:28,360 --> 00:05:29,519
(Let righteousness shine.)

93
00:05:29,759 --> 00:05:30,839
(Let righteousness shine.)

94
00:05:42,480 --> 00:05:43,959
(When you master this art,)

95
00:05:44,680 --> 00:05:46,759
(then even if I'm gone,)

96
00:05:48,519 --> 00:05:49,759
(you can protect yourself)

97
00:05:50,000 --> 00:05:51,160
(and suffer no more.)

98
00:06:01,639 --> 00:06:03,199
(I searched everywhere)

99
00:06:03,600 --> 00:06:05,920
(and this young Taoist is my cure.)

100
00:06:13,639 --> 00:06:15,240
Why did you teach me this?

101
00:06:21,920 --> 00:06:23,000
You want to eat me.

102
00:06:23,560 --> 00:06:25,079
But the bite mark hasn't appeared.

103
00:06:25,439 --> 00:06:26,920
Eating me won't help.

104
00:06:28,680 --> 00:06:31,720
Only I can make it appear.

105
00:06:35,800 --> 00:06:37,000
Let's make a deal.

106
00:06:38,240 --> 00:06:39,759
Join me.

107
00:06:39,759 --> 00:06:41,480
We kill Yu Linjun.

108
00:06:48,600 --> 00:06:50,319
So that's why you came to me.

109
00:06:52,160 --> 00:06:53,560
After we mend the Sky Rift,

110
00:06:54,000 --> 00:06:55,160
I'm yours.

111
00:06:59,720 --> 00:07:01,639
What makes you think I'd agree?

112
00:07:02,720 --> 00:07:03,519
You will.

113
00:07:07,079 --> 00:07:09,120
(If he's really my cure,)

114
00:07:09,120 --> 00:07:11,879
(let's see what he's got.)

115
00:07:21,160 --> 00:07:22,720
(That mark...)

116
00:07:23,360 --> 00:07:25,040
(Could it be...)

117
00:07:25,600 --> 00:07:27,360
(Stone Curse?)

118
00:07:57,439 --> 00:08:01,199
(My Lord, have you felt
anything strange lately?)

119
00:08:01,639 --> 00:08:06,199
The Stone's memories
of the Mortal Realm are gone.

120
00:08:06,639 --> 00:08:09,959
Even the Wind God technique
can't stop me now.

121
00:08:10,839 --> 00:08:12,120
But why

122
00:08:12,720 --> 00:08:15,439
when I tried to consume her,

123
00:08:16,199 --> 00:08:21,279
why could Chi Xiao stop me?

124
00:08:22,480 --> 00:08:24,600
(Chi Xiao is your incarnation.)

125
00:08:25,240 --> 00:08:27,720
(He loves the Stone.)

126
00:08:28,279 --> 00:08:31,160
(That's why he protected her
without thinking.)

127
00:08:32,320 --> 00:08:38,639
So that's why I can't devour her.

128
00:08:39,519 --> 00:08:40,799
(That is one reason.)

129
00:08:41,200 --> 00:08:45,039
(You and the Demon Queen
were once one Stone.)

130
00:08:45,600 --> 00:08:47,320
(Split in two by accident.)

131
00:08:48,279 --> 00:08:50,639
(But two halves of the same Stone
repel each other.)

132
00:08:52,200 --> 00:08:53,399
No matter what,

133
00:08:55,960 --> 00:08:58,320
I'll devour

134
00:08:58,320 --> 00:08:59,600
the whole Divine Stone

135
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:01,440
and rule both realms.

136
00:09:02,360 --> 00:09:05,639
(Chi Xiao's love for the Stone
is bound to you.)

137
00:09:06,320 --> 00:09:07,759
(If you force it,)

138
00:09:08,360 --> 00:09:10,399
(the Stone will fight back,)

139
00:09:10,879 --> 00:09:12,639
(and Chi Xiao's love)

140
00:09:12,679 --> 00:09:13,759
(will tear you apart.)

141
00:09:14,399 --> 00:09:15,799
Then tell me,

142
00:09:17,519 --> 00:09:18,720
what should I do?

143
00:09:19,960 --> 00:09:24,559
(Make the other half of the Stone
fall in love.)

144
00:09:25,000 --> 00:09:26,885
(Make Shangguan Ziyan love you.)

145
00:09:26,886 --> 00:09:27,639
(Then,)

146
00:09:28,639 --> 00:09:31,039
(your Demon Flower
and her Love Flower will merge.)

147
00:09:31,879 --> 00:09:33,480
(Only then can you devour her.)

148
00:09:34,080 --> 00:09:35,399
Love? Please.

149
00:09:36,080 --> 00:09:37,480
I have no use for it.

150
00:09:40,360 --> 00:09:42,000
Is there another way?

151
00:09:43,080 --> 00:09:45,879
(Find someone she deeply loves.)

152
00:09:46,279 --> 00:09:48,080
(That can also
make her Love Flower bloom.)

153
00:09:48,639 --> 00:09:50,039
(Besides Shangguan Lanxi,)

154
00:09:50,720 --> 00:09:52,360
(I know of one other.)

155
00:09:54,320 --> 00:09:57,279
(She raised the Demon Queen
since childhood.)

156
00:09:57,919 --> 00:09:59,919
(Their bond is sincere and deep.)

157
00:10:08,279 --> 00:10:10,200
It is your honor
to catch our Lord's eye.

158
00:10:10,320 --> 00:10:11,320
Stay in line.

159
00:10:11,879 --> 00:10:12,679
Senior.

160
00:10:12,960 --> 00:10:13,759
Yuanchu.

161
00:10:16,039 --> 00:10:17,159
Look at me.

162
00:10:17,440 --> 00:10:18,240
Senior.

163
00:10:20,320 --> 00:10:21,399
What are you going to do?

164
00:10:23,720 --> 00:10:24,519
Ziyan.

165
00:10:25,360 --> 00:10:28,600
There's someone in there I need to save.

166
00:10:30,440 --> 00:10:32,000
You don't have a shred of power left.

167
00:10:32,120 --> 00:10:33,759
And you want to charge in and die?

168
00:10:35,679 --> 00:10:36,480
Senior.

169
00:10:39,399 --> 00:10:41,440
I'm starving today.

170
00:10:42,080 --> 00:10:44,120
So I'll keep this

171
00:10:44,120 --> 00:10:46,720
rather unimpressive thing.

172
00:10:47,240 --> 00:10:47,960
I...

173
00:10:47,960 --> 00:10:50,039
Our Lord is waiting.

174
00:10:50,600 --> 00:10:52,440
I won't say it twice.

175
00:10:53,600 --> 00:10:55,559
The Demon Queen is precious to our Lord.

176
00:10:56,080 --> 00:10:57,480
We wouldn't dare disobey.

177
00:10:58,200 --> 00:10:59,000
Ha.

178
00:11:01,720 --> 00:11:02,639
The rest of you, come with me.

179
00:11:03,279 --> 00:11:04,080
Yuanchu.

180
00:11:04,679 --> 00:11:05,159
Hurry!

181
00:11:05,159 --> 00:11:06,559
You scared me to death!

182
00:11:06,559 --> 00:11:07,960
I thought you were dead.

183
00:11:08,159 --> 00:11:09,480
Oh, thank goodness.

184
00:11:10,919 --> 00:11:12,480
I am so glad you are alright.

185
00:11:12,720 --> 00:11:13,519
I am fine.

186
00:11:14,440 --> 00:11:15,399
Are you okay?

187
00:11:15,960 --> 00:11:16,759
Mm.

188
00:11:17,600 --> 00:11:19,399
Ziyan, thank goodness.

189
00:11:19,399 --> 00:11:20,320
You are safe too.

190
00:11:23,399 --> 00:11:24,200
Master.

191
00:11:24,639 --> 00:11:27,000
I didn't fail you.

192
00:11:28,320 --> 00:11:29,120
Yuanchu,

193
00:11:29,720 --> 00:11:31,600
I recall Master said before his death.

194
00:11:31,600 --> 00:11:32,639
There is a demon poison.

195
00:11:32,799 --> 00:11:34,679
that, when combined
with Heavenly Justice,

196
00:11:34,799 --> 00:11:36,360
Tearless Tear, and Underworld Soul,

197
00:11:36,879 --> 00:11:38,679
can kill any demon in this world.

198
00:11:40,120 --> 00:11:41,159
The stronger the demon,

199
00:11:41,600 --> 00:11:42,480
the deadlier the poison.

200
00:11:43,440 --> 00:11:46,159
This young man has a kind heart.

201
00:11:46,720 --> 00:11:48,000
Though we have never met before,

202
00:11:48,159 --> 00:11:50,159
you've given me such useful information.

203
00:11:51,039 --> 00:11:52,360
We've never met?

204
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:53,799
Ziyan,

205
00:11:54,240 --> 00:11:57,080
have you forgotten your lovable,
mighty senior?

206
00:11:57,480 --> 00:11:58,759
We used to...

207
00:12:01,240 --> 00:12:02,519
Ziyan has lost her memories.

208
00:12:06,120 --> 00:12:07,440
She doesn't remember

209
00:12:07,480 --> 00:12:08,600
everything about the Mortal Realm,

210
00:12:09,879 --> 00:12:10,759
including us.

211
00:12:15,360 --> 00:12:17,159
Don't worry.

212
00:12:17,639 --> 00:12:19,159
Whether you remember me or not,

213
00:12:19,240 --> 00:12:21,679
you will always be my dear friend
and sister-in-law.

214
00:12:22,360 --> 00:12:24,559
I will find a way
to bring your memories back.

215
00:12:24,919 --> 00:12:26,759
Speaking of the day we met,

216
00:12:27,360 --> 00:12:29,480
it was a bright sunny afternoon.

217
00:12:29,960 --> 00:12:30,759
We were together...

218
00:12:30,759 --> 00:12:31,559
Enough!

219
00:12:33,200 --> 00:12:35,000
I only trust my own memories.

220
00:12:39,919 --> 00:12:40,720
Ah?

221
00:12:43,919 --> 00:12:44,720
(Ziyan,)

222
00:12:45,279 --> 00:12:48,360
(how can I make you remember me?)

223
00:13:04,800 --> 00:13:08,728
♪I drink the rain of this mortal world,
and seek the path I chose♪

224
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:12,173
♪How much sorrow and joy have I known?♪

225
00:13:12,214 --> 00:13:15,728
♪With this flesh and blood,
I chase the distant light♪

226
00:13:15,914 --> 00:13:18,848
♪Just to see clearly
the memories of this drifting life♪

227
00:13:19,128 --> 00:13:25,898
♪Let the wind sweep away
this heavy air of sorrow♪

228
00:13:26,544 --> 00:13:33,232
♪Do not forget the tangled paths
that you and I have crossed♪

229
00:13:34,138 --> 00:13:37,808
♪Let towering waves come crashing down,
I'll fight against the tide♪

230
00:13:37,918 --> 00:13:41,608
♪I shatter
the hollow fate they wrote for me♪

231
00:13:41,780 --> 00:13:48,014
♪With a heart free of regret,
I'll face the heavens and earth♪
